# Secrets. `.env*.local` alone left a plain `.env` or `.env.production`
# trackable, and those are the files people actually paste live Supabase
# service-role keys into. Ignore every env file, then re-admit the committed
# template: README.md and docs/SETUP.md both point at `.env.example`, so it
# has to stay tracked or the setup runbook breaks.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo


.vercel
